- if {[info exists ::env(TOP)] && $::env(TOP) ne ""} { set TOP $::env(TOP) } else { set fh [open "./top_module.txt" r]; set TOP [string trim [read $fh]]; close $fh }
This keeps bundle metadata and Tcl behavior from diverging when the inferred top changes.

